# nr-exthost-pdf-cff-type1 wire fragment

No Cargo, workspace, protocol or compose_flip change: mixdog-pdf is already a workspace member, the readers use only
crates it already depends on (tracing), and fontfile/mod.rs already declares `cff` and `type1`.

NOTICE.md (root), add a section under the third-party data sections, after the last data section:

    ### Foxit Symbol and Dingbats standard font programs (pdfjs-dist 6.4.299)

    `native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/src/fontfile/stdfonts/FoxitSymbol.pfb` and `FoxitDingbats.pfb` are the standard
    font programs pdf.js 6.4.299 ships for non-embedded Symbol and ZapfDingbats. Their license text is carried
    unchanged in `native/core/crates/mixdog-pdf/src/fontfile/stdfonts/LICENSE_FOXIT`.

Packaging: the two .pfb files are include_bytes! data of the crate; nothing to copy at packaging time.
